    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūsaalwa mu Giligaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū pye a batemi ba Baamooli a ba kū nkīlo gwa ng'weli ya mongo gwa Yolodani, na a batemi ba Bakanaani a bose abo baalī kū ng'hilimva ya nyanza aho bigwa gīkī ū SEEBA wagūkamije ū mongo gwa Yolodani kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli, kūshisha tūūkīla pye a bose, ī ng'holò jabo jikahaahūka, būgayiwa gete ī nguzu ja kūmanhya na a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Beejaga shū ja mawe madiimu, ūbasaale hangī a Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Yoshwa ūbeeja shū ja mawe madiimu, ūūkabasaalīla a Baisilaeli Gibeati-haalaloti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gibeati-haalaloti:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, itūmbī lya kūsaalīlwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa akabasaala kūlwa nguno ya gīkī, pye abo baalī bafuma mu sī ya Misili, a bagosha ba myaka ya kūdūla kūja kū būlūgū, bakachīla ng'witogolo aho balī mu nzīla balīfuma ī Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a banhū abo baalī bafuma Misili baalī baasaalwa; alīyo pye abo bakabyalīlwa ng'witogolo mu lūgendo lwa kūfuma Misili, a bene batasaalilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli baalī baamal'ikanza lya myaka makūmi anè bakūyūnga yūngaga ū ng'witogolo, kūshisha pye a banhū abo baalī bashikile kūja kū būlūgū būshila kūcha aho balīfuma Misili; nguno baalī batang'wigwile ū SEEBA. Na lūūlū ū SEEBA walī wabilahīlīla gīkī batūdūla ū kwībona ī sī īyo walī wabisagīja bakūlūgenji babo mu kwilahīla, gīkī akūtwinha; ī sī ya būhondo ī ya kūsūlūlūka būkī na mabeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūbagūngūmūla bitūnja babo a ha ng'wanya gwabo; a benaba hū bene abo Yoshwa akabasaala. Baalī bataalī ū kūsaalwa, nguno baalī batasaalilwe ū mu nzīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī lihanga ī lyose aho lyamala kūsaalwa, bikala ha ng'hambī henaho, kūshisha būpīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wila ū Yoshwa gīkī, “Ī lelo yenīyī nīpilingītījaga kūle ī minala ya Misili yang'wīngīlaga a bing'we.” Na lūūlū ī lipandī lyenīlo litanwa Giligaali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Giligaali:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho ū mu Shihebulania gene kūpilingitya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kūshisha lelo īyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shigukulu sha Pasaka mu Giligaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwahayūshika ū lūshikū lw'ikūmi na inè lwa ng'weji, a Baisilaeli būlya Pasaka aho balī a ha ng'hambī ya Giligaali yenīyo, ū mu mbūga ya Yeliko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo ya lūshikū lwa Pasaka, ū lūshikū lwenūlo, būlya matwajo gamò na gamò ga mu sī yenīyo; migatī ītī na shibimbya, hamò na shilīwa sha būkalange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī eemanu yooya ū kwilonga kwīngīīla ha ntondo yaho, a ha ntondo ya lūshikū lwa kūshilya ī shilwa sha mu sī yenīyo. Kwīngīīla ikanza lyenīlo a Baisilaeli bataliile eemanu hangī, gwike ū ng'waka gwenūyo būlya sha kūfuma mu matwajo ga mu sī ya Kanaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshwa na ngosha wa līlūshū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balī bbihī na Yeliko, ū Yoshwa wahayūbūūcha a miso, ūmona ngosha īmīīlile kū būtongi wakwe, walī na līlūshū mu nkono gwakwe līsopoolilwe ū mu shilaalo shalyo. Ū Yoshwa ūng'wegeela ūmūūja, “Ū bebe ūlī kū lwande lwise, nūūlū lwa banishi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Yaya ītī gīko; ū nene hū nalī ntaale wa mabità ga ng'wa SEEBA, nashika lūūlū ī haha.” A henaho ū Yoshwa ūgwa hasī achimīgīje kūlwa kūnkūja; ūmūūja, “Ū SEEBA alī na mhayo kī gwa kūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa mabità ga ng'wa SEEBA ūnshokeja, “Zuulaga ī shilatū shako, nguno a hipaandī īlo wīmīīlaga halī heela.” Ū Yoshwa wīta chene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
